1
00:00:14,599 --> 00:00:16,160
All 300 imperial guards were wiped out.

2
00:00:16,559 --> 00:00:18,000
The Imperial Bodyguard

3
00:00:18,359 --> 00:00:19,280
is indeed as formidable as its reputation.

4
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,160
But at this moment,

5
00:00:21,839 --> 00:00:23,480
you are at the end of your tether.

6
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,239
Xiao Yunshang,

7
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,000
you manipulated my father, framed the Crown Prince,

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:28,760
and harmed palace maids.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,519
Your crimes are unforgivable.

10
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:33,159
Even if I have to die today,

11
00:00:34,079 --> 00:00:35,840
I will kill you with my own hands.

12
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,520
Do you really think I wouldn't dare to kill you?

13
00:00:42,679 --> 00:00:43,600
Go ahead and try.

14
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:45,159
If you kill me,

15
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:47,200
your father won't live either.

16
00:00:53,439 --> 00:00:54,439
See?

17
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,240
I took

18
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,920
the mother pill of the poison,

19
00:00:58,359 --> 00:01:00,920
while the son pill is in your body.

20
00:01:01,399 --> 00:01:03,600
The mother dies, the son must die too.

21
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,319
Your Royal Highness,

22
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,439
do you want to kill your father?

23
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,760
You crazy woman!

24
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:15,640
Your Majesty,

25
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:18,480
the witch, Feng Zhiwei, tried to escape in a carriage.

26
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:19,719
We chased her,

27
00:01:20,079 --> 00:01:20,799
and she fell off a cliff.

28
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:21,920
The carriage was destroyed,

29
00:01:22,519 --> 00:01:23,439
and there were no remains left.

30
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,840
What did you say?

31
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,480
Feng... Feng...

32
00:01:28,079 --> 00:01:29,040
Feng Zhwei fell off the cliff.

33
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:30,560
There is no chance of survival.

34
00:01:33,519 --> 00:01:35,359
This is the East Palace pendant

35
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,359
I found on the body at the bottom of the cliff.

36
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,439
You useless fool.

37
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,519
You can't even protect

38
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:49,400
your own woman.

39
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:53,359
I'm gonna kill you.

40
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:01,560
Miss Feng, I...

41
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,879
I'm gonna kill you.

42
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,840
All of you will be buried with her.

43
00:02:22,319 --> 00:02:23,080
The madman Yexuan

44
00:02:23,199 --> 00:02:24,639
is hiding inside your body.

45
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,639
I've got a plan.

46
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,560
The magic of the green phoenix

47
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,680
is really useful.

48
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:31,560
Guards!

49
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,039
Take Gu Jiachen to the prison.

50
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:35,680
Keep an eye on her.

51
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:41,840
Your Majesty,

52
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:44,080
the Crown Prince Xuyi rebelled.

53
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,240
He should be deposed.

54
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:46,800
Please issue an imperial edict.

55
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,840
Gu Jiachen's crimes are

56
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,439
clearly proven.

57
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:01,879
He's stripped of his title.

58
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,560
and sentenced to death

59
00:04:03,879 --> 00:04:06,080
in the afternoon three days later.

60
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,560
It must be nonsense.

61
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,759
The Crown Prince is kind.

62
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,639
How could he hurt His Majesty?

63
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:13,759
Grandma, be careful.

64
00:04:13,759 --> 00:04:15,120
The throne must be his.

65
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:20,040
Gu Jiachen.

66
00:04:26,199 --> 00:04:26,839
My Lady.

67
00:04:26,959 --> 00:04:28,000
There are too many of them.

68
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:29,040
We...

69
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,240
We can't escape.

70
00:04:33,959 --> 00:04:34,319
Don't be afraid.

71
00:04:34,959 --> 00:04:36,240
We can survive in the most desperate situation.

72
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:39,160
Let alone we are not in a desperate situation.

73
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:44,079
The front is a cliff.

74
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,480
We can't hold on for long.

75
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:47,560
My Lady,

76
00:04:47,759 --> 00:04:48,959
let Shen Li protect you and go first.

77
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,639
I'll lure the pursuers away for you.

78
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:51,680
What are you talking about?

79
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,040
You are my family.

80
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:53,879
I will never

81
00:04:53,879 --> 00:04:54,720
leave you behind.

82
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,879
Because we are family,

83
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:59,240
we are worth protecting with life.

84
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,040
If it weren't for you,

85
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,639
I would have starved to death long ago.

86
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,879
I'm already satisfied

87
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,680
to accompany you to know Lord Shen.

88
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,800
I said no!

89
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:11,600
Chase!

90
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,040
We're running out of time!

91
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:20,160
My Lady, look!

92
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,160
Mr Shen.

93
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:41,480
Susu,

94
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:42,560
we have different masters.

95
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:44,120
You protect your princess,

96
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:45,519
while I must

97
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:46,439
protect my lady.

98
00:05:47,519 --> 00:05:47,879
See,

99
00:05:48,879 --> 00:05:49,839
I've mastered

100
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:51,360
the palm strike you taught me.

101
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:53,319
I knocked out my lady in one go.

102
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,759
If possible,

103
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,120
I would like to learn more

104
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:57,959
from you.

105
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,240
Shen Li,

106
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,560
take care of Miss Su for me,

107
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:04,439
and take care of yourself.

108
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:06,879
Go!

109
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:46,759
Shen Li!

110
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,800
She's so timid,

111
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:50,959
and it's rare for her

112
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,000
to find someone she likes.

113
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:54,959
How could she have sacrificed herself for me?

114
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,000
Shen Li!

115
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:02,839
Su has fought with all her might

116
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:05,079
to give us this chance.

117
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,920
It's not the time to cry.

118
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,279
Lady Feng,

119
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:12,199
time is running out.

120
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,120
We need to find a way

121
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:15,319
to rescue Gu Jiachen quickly.

122
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:18,040
My Lady, My Lady,

123
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,560
there's a long queue today.

124
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,560
But I finally got

125
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,680
Mr. Qingqiao's new painting book.

126
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,240
Thanks to you,

127
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,720
you'll be richly rewarded.

128
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,439
I've thought of a way to get into the palace.

129
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,639
Lady Feng,

130
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,399
who are you waiting for?

131
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,120
Who would risk their life

132
00:07:39,519 --> 00:07:41,199
to save His Highness at this juncture?

133
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:42,639
Shen Li,

134
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:44,319
you really have forgotten

135
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,759
all about me.

136
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,040
Mr. Qingqiao,

137
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,399
I finally see you.

138
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:55,920
Fortunately, as soon as your comic book

139
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,680
is updated,

140
00:07:56,759 --> 00:07:57,759
someone will deliver it

141
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,920
to me immediately.

142
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,240
That's how I didn't miss

143
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,160
the distress signal.

144
00:08:02,639 --> 00:08:04,920
The new plot of the comic book is

145
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,079
the prince in trouble,

146
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,519
the messenger risked his life to rescue,

147
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,600
but was stopped at the palace gate,

148
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,959
the mysterious princess came to the rescue,

149
00:08:10,079 --> 00:08:11,199
and then met at the tea house.

150
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:13,800
I guessed that Mr. Qingqiao was in trouble,

151
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,079
so I went straight to the tea house

152
00:08:15,399 --> 00:08:16,199
to wait for you.

153
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,480
Your Highness and Feng

154
00:08:19,079 --> 00:08:20,920
are really on the same page.

155
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,399
I know Your Highness is a loyal fan,

156
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:27,879
so I took a gamble.

157
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:29,800
Thank you for your help.

158
00:08:30,959 --> 00:08:32,320
Please, no formalities.

159
00:08:32,679 --> 00:08:33,000
Have a seat.

160
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,960
Half of what I did today

161
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,279
was for you,

162
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,320
and the other half

163
00:08:43,519 --> 00:08:44,679
was for my brother.

164
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:46,919
He

165
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,759
has already revealed your true identity

166
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,720
to me,

167
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:51,200
and asked me to protect you

168
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:52,919
if necessary.

169
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:56,080
He always plans for me,

170
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:57,799
why wouldn't he

171
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,080
leave himself a way out?

172
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,360
I think for you,

173
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,600
no matter when,

174
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:03,879
your safety

175
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:06,000
is his biggest way out.

176
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:09,759
That night, outside the Palace,

177
00:09:10,039 --> 00:09:11,440
I knew that the Crown Prince

178
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,480
was locked up there.

179
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:27,080
Princess Arietty

180
00:09:27,399 --> 00:09:28,399
You can only stay for a while,

181
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,320
otherwise,

182
00:09:29,559 --> 00:09:30,720
I can't explain to the Noble Consort.

183
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,480
How dare you use the Noble Consort to pressure me?

184
00:09:32,679 --> 00:09:33,960
Do you believe I will tell the Empress Dowager

185
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,600
to cut off your head at once?

186
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:36,799
Hand over the key!

187
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,120
You, stay back and keep watch!

188
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:38,919
Yes, sir!

189
00:09:55,679 --> 00:09:57,000
Gu Jiachen, wake up!

190
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:57,960
It's me!

191
00:09:58,399 --> 00:09:59,080
We're here to save you!

192
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,480
I knew it!

193
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:13,039
My little phoenix can rise from the ashes!

194
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,519
Fu Yi,

195
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,879
our useless Crown Prince

196
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:27,559
has been soaking in the water dungeon for two days.

197
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,480
I wonder if his bones have softened.

198
00:10:31,039 --> 00:10:32,399
Now, with the suppression of all souls,

199
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,399
he is no different

200
00:10:34,919 --> 00:10:35,639
from a useless person.

201
00:10:38,879 --> 00:10:39,720
Gu Jiachen,

202
00:10:40,519 --> 00:10:42,120
you'll leave tomorrow.

203
00:10:42,879 --> 00:10:44,720
I come to see you off

204
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,679
for our old days.

205
00:10:47,399 --> 00:10:49,080
But don't be afraid of loneliness.

206
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,159
After you die,

207
00:10:51,759 --> 00:10:53,840
I'll send your father

208
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,480
to accompany you.

209
00:10:56,879 --> 00:10:58,799
My only regret now

210
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:01,159
is to let Feng Zhiwei

211
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,240
die a little faster.

212
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,120
Shen Li,

213
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,039
how could it be you?

214
00:11:33,519 --> 00:11:34,519
[Gu Jiachen once said,]

215
00:11:35,039 --> 00:11:36,080
the capital is surrounded by parties,

216
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:37,480
only the troops outside the city

217
00:11:37,519 --> 00:11:38,559
obey the imperial order.

218
00:11:38,879 --> 00:11:40,080
But the situation in the army is unclear,

219
00:11:40,559 --> 00:11:41,360
we must be careful.

220
00:11:42,039 --> 00:11:43,360
Little Phoenix, don't worry,

221
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,960
I've brought something that ensures victory.

222
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,080
Your Highness,

223
00:12:00,919 --> 00:12:02,120
your identity is special today.

224
00:12:02,639 --> 00:12:03,360
His Majesty said

225
00:12:03,639 --> 00:12:04,919
you killed the emperor and ordered a manhunt.

226
00:12:05,639 --> 00:12:07,200
Even if the soldiers admire you,

227
00:12:07,679 --> 00:12:08,840
as a soldier,

228
00:12:08,879 --> 00:12:09,600
I dare not let you in.

229
00:12:10,399 --> 00:12:12,120
Please don't make it difficult for us.

230
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,240
Leave now.

231
00:12:16,799 --> 00:12:17,360
I missed.

232
00:12:17,879 --> 00:12:19,200
I intended to throw it into your mouth.

233
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,720
You guys,

234
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,919
kneel faster than anyone,

235
00:12:26,679 --> 00:12:28,279
and speak more sweetly than anyone.

236
00:12:28,879 --> 00:12:31,000
Admire? Don't want to make it difficult for you?

237
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,039
But

238
00:12:32,559 --> 00:12:33,879
you still want to drive me away.

239
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:35,399
-Your Highness, I... -Enough.

240
00:12:35,679 --> 00:12:36,840
I understand you.

241
00:12:37,559 --> 00:12:39,240
Orders from above, and threats from below.

242
00:12:39,559 --> 00:12:41,240
It's hard to be in the middle.

243
00:12:43,679 --> 00:12:45,960
Let's put it this way.

244
00:12:46,159 --> 00:12:46,559
Bro.

245
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:49,159
Do you think the emperor's order

246
00:12:49,679 --> 00:12:51,159
is his own will?

247
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:53,480
Well...

248
00:12:56,159 --> 00:12:57,080
Don't pretend.

249
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,559
Everyone in the city knows

250
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:01,000
that Consort Xiao controls the harem.

251
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:02,320
Even the emperor's medicine

252
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:03,080
has to go through her.

253
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,360
The emperor

254
00:13:04,399 --> 00:13:06,000
was still unconscious in bed yesterday.

255
00:13:06,559 --> 00:13:07,600
How could he issue an order

256
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,519
to kill his own son today?

257
00:13:09,919 --> 00:13:10,639
I think,

258
00:13:11,039 --> 00:13:11,519
the order

259
00:13:11,879 --> 00:13:12,759
is like the noodles

260
00:13:12,759 --> 00:13:13,759
cooked in the noodle shop.

261
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,919
Whoever ordered it is the owner.

262
00:13:16,559 --> 00:13:16,960
Your Highness,

263
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:18,159
even so,

264
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,000
without the tiger token,

265
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,000
we dare not...

266
00:13:21,679 --> 00:13:23,799
You should say it earlier. You want the tiger token?

267
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:27,480
This one?

268
00:13:28,399 --> 00:13:30,759
According to the law of Li State,

269
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:33,440
seeing this token is like seeing the emperor.

270
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:34,960
You should

271
00:13:35,759 --> 00:13:36,720
recognize this, right?

272
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:40,080
What?

273
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,320
You suspect that I'm fooling you with a fake one?

274
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:44,360
Come on.

275
00:13:44,759 --> 00:13:45,600
Have a bite.

276
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,080
It's made of copper, and it's hard.

277
00:13:47,759 --> 00:13:48,440
I dare not.

278
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:51,840
Where did you

279
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:52,720
get this thing?

280
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:55,080
I hid it secretly

281
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,440
to revenge that old man.

282
00:13:56,799 --> 00:13:57,960
I remembered it when I came out of the palace,

283
00:13:58,159 --> 00:13:58,919
so I brought it with me.

284
00:14:01,919 --> 00:14:02,639
All right.

285
00:14:02,639 --> 00:14:03,159
Stand up.

286
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,240
Let me ask you,

287
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,039
what's the punishment

288
00:14:07,759 --> 00:14:08,639
for disobeying this?

289
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:10,759
I'll

290
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:12,960
follow your order.

291
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:13,480
Rise.

292
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:15,960
Don't kneel. It's cold.

293
00:14:23,159 --> 00:14:23,639
How was that?

294
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,759
Am I a genius?

295
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:26,720
You're awesome.

296
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:27,559
Of course.

297
00:14:29,559 --> 00:14:29,879
By the way,

298
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:30,960
gather your men.

299
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,279
Half an hour later,

300
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,759
follow me to the palace.

301
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:35,519
And,

302
00:14:36,039 --> 00:14:36,799
remember to eat

303
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,039
the apple I gave you.

304
00:14:38,559 --> 00:14:39,039
Don't waste it.

305
00:14:43,679 --> 00:14:44,320
[Gu Jiachen,]

306
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,519
[have you become this weak?]

307
00:14:47,399 --> 00:14:48,799
[I can barely feel]

308
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:49,559
[your presence.]

309
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:50,919
[How will I]

310
00:14:51,559 --> 00:14:53,240
[explain this to the little phoenix?]
